silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_02_concrete_anchor_5#rdftypearrow silm:hasLongDescription "The RdfTypeArrow is the type assertion arrow Mittens -> Cat. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'rdf:type', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
